        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SKY100FAL, Square Acrylic Offset Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Square Acrylic Door Pull features offset mounts. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from frosted or clear acrylic. The First Impressions Sky Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sky 100 Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SKY01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262334\"><b>First Impressions SKY100FAL Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>FII-SKY100012FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.02\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100024FAL:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.02\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SKY100036FAL:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.02\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Square Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "The Modern Square Acrylic Door Pull features offset mounts. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from frosted or clear acrylic. The First Impressions Sky Door Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
